8. Multiple restaurant/bar outlets and POS terminals.
9. Menu, modifiers, orders, discounts, payments and room posting.
10. KOT, preparation stations, KDS and printer routing.
11. Laundry, gym, pool and transport services.
12. Housekeeping and maintenance workflows.
13. Central and department inventory, procurement and suppliers.
