**Charge record**

- Unique transaction ID.
- Property and business date.
- Guest, stay, room and folio references.
- Department and outlet.
- Source module and source transaction ID.
- Description and quantity.
- Gross/base amount.
- Discount and reason.
- Tax components.
- Net total.
- Posting status.
- Created by and approved by.
